sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Storefront as Customer Storefront
    participant Backend as Supabase Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Admin as Admin Workspace

    Customer->>Storefront: Confirm selected cart items and delivery details
    Storefront->>Backend: Submit validated checkout request
    Backend->>DB: Create order, items, totals, and initial status
    DB-->>Backend: Return order number and stored totals
    Backend-->>Storefront: Return confirmed order
    Storefront-->>Customer: Show order confirmation
    DB-->>Admin: Realtime INSERT event for new order
    Admin->>DB: Set Processing or Packed with timestamp
    DB-->>Storefront: Publish status and timestamp update
    Storefront-->>Customer: Refresh delivery progress
    Admin->>DB: Set Shipped or Delivered with timestamp
    DB-->>Storefront: Publish current order state
    Storefront-->>Customer: Show final tracking and review eligibility
